Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Playing for real.
