Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.21,0:01:03.78,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\an3\b1}Serious Mammal Hero{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.74,0:01:03.50,texto normal,,0,0,0,,I also want to draw the ultimate hero manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:05.07,texto normal,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.26,texto normal,,0,0,0,,He said the manga he read was so interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:08.77,texto normal,,0,0,0,,that he wants to draw one himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:11.92,texto normal,,0,0,0,,But I can't think of a good character.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:13.22,texto normal,,0,0,0,,In that case, welcome to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:15.94,texto normal,,0,0,0,,THE WORLD OF SERIOUS PALEOTOLOGY!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.51,0:01:23.29,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dino.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:26.47,texto normal,,0,0,0,,How about getting hero ideas from prehistoric creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:27.54,texto normal,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:30.02,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Then modern animals would also be great, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:30.40,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.76,texto normal,,0,0,0,,But aren't prehistoric creatures better?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.91,0:01:34.09,texto normal,,0,0,0,,No, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:35.76,texto normal,,0,0,0,, modern animals are definitely better!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:39.37,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Then let's have a showdown to see which creature is better
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:41.67,texto normal,,0,0,0,,suited for a hero character!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:42.74,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:44.58,texto normal,,0,0,0,,First strike wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:48.30,texto normal,,0,0,0,,How about the African elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:50.46,texto normal,,0,0,0,,It has thick and tough skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.77,0:01:52.83,texto normal,,0,0,0,,and enough power to lift a car
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:55.39,texto normal,,0,0,0,,a super strong hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:57.57,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that sounds cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.92,0:01:59.24,texto normal,,0,0,0,,An African elephant, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.09,texto normal,,0,0,0,,If so,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:01.17,texto normal,,0,0,0,,long tusks...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:05.24,texto normal,,0,0,0,,a mammoth would feel much more like a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:07.56,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Covered in body hair from head to toe,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:10.02,texto normal,,0,0,0,,it can withstand any freezing cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.83,0:02:12.39,texto normal,,0,0,0,,a fluffy hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:13.20,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:15.54,texto normal,,0,0,0,, A hero whose strength is resisting cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:17.17,texto normal,,0,0,0,,A Woolly Mammoth, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:18.71,texto normal,,0,0,0,,That's interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.88,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Then how about a modern creature...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:24.31,texto normal,,0,0,0,,.like a lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:26.48,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Catching prey with sharp claws,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.86,0:02:28.86,texto normal,,0,0,0,,it's known as the King of Beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.06,texto normal,,0,0,0,,a mane hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:33.38,texto normal,,0,0,0,,A king and a hero?! \NThat's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.73,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Male lions are basically free-loaders, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:36.32,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:38.67,texto normal,,0,0,0,,The females do most of the hunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:41.22,texto normal,,0,0,0,,and the males just live off their prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:43.31,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Instead of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:45.62,texto normal,,0,0,0,,how about a prehistoric saber-toothed cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:49.80,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Specifically speaking, what about Smilodon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.11,0:02:51.27,texto normal,,0,0,0,,With cool tusks
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:53.34,texto normal,,0,0,0,,and powerful forelegs,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.57,texto normal,,0,0,0,,it's a saber hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.34,texto normal,,0,0,0,,No wait, it's drooling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:02:59.20,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Why won't it close its mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:02.55,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Smilodon can open its mouth up to 120 degrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:04.13,texto normal,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:08.52,texto normal,,0,0,0,,I push for a modern animal: the kangaroo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:11.44,texto normal,,0,0,0,,With over 50% of its body made of muscle...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:15.94,texto normal,,0,0,0,,it's a muscular hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:16.69,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:18.48,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Its suit is falling off though?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:19.98,texto normal,,0,0,0,,It's a good idea but,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:21.78,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Smilodon's tusks won't lose either!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:22.51,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Objection!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.08,0:03:24.90,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Smilodon's tusks are long,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:27.29,texto normal,,0,0,0,,so they break easily, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:27.68,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.01,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Dino using prehistoric knowledge?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:32.87,texto normal,,0,0,0,,A hero's tusks and heart of justice...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:33.76,texto normal,,0,0,0,,WILL NEVER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:36.26,texto normal,,0,0,0,,BE BROKEN!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:38.91,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Well said! That sounds so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:41.86,texto normal,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:42.82,texto normal,,0,0,0,,When did you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:44.65,texto normal,,0,0,0,,get so knowledgeable about prehistoric creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:45.78,texto normal,,0,0,0,,I've been
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:47.44,texto normal,,0,0,0,,studying every single day too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.02,0:03:55.44,texto normal,,0,0,0,,I'm taking on the challenge with an undaunted fighting spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:56.91,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Dino...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:02.70,texto normal,,0,0,0,,What's with you all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:05.67,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Perhaps there's no longer any need to insist on choosing between modern or prehistoric creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.98,0:04:08.53,texto normal,,0,0,0,,between modern or prehistoric creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:10.14,texto normal,,0,0,0,,President?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:12.47,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Why don't we create it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:14.88,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Combining both our ideas
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:17.60,texto normal,,0,0,0,,into one ultimate creature-respecting hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.87,0:04:18.54,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:24.02,texto normal,,0,0,0,,The power of an African elephant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:25.96,texto normal,,0,0,0,,The thick fur of a Woolly Mammoth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:27.94,texto normal,,0,0,0,,The mane of a lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.52,0:04:29.92,texto normal,,0,0,0,,The jaw of a Smilodon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.41,0:04:31.98,texto normal,,0,0,0,,The muscle of a kangaroo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.14,texto normal,,0,0,0,,This is our...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.28,texto normal,,0,0,0,,ideal hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:48.22,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:51.97,texto normal,,0,0,0,,Cramming all that together makes it look scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:53.07,texto normal,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:53.69,texto normal,,0,0,0,, no matter
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:56.31,texto normal,,0,0,0,,how you look at it, isn't that a villain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:05:00.08,ultimo,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your support during this short time! \NPlease look forward to Dino-sensei and Tetori-sensei's \Nnext work!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:05:00.08,ultimo(2),,0,0,0,,Plannosaurus Serious Paleontology Club... To be continued.\N Next time, the anime final episode: 'Serious Mata-Kamen's Trial'.
